# Elixir's formatter always writes LF; letting Windows checkouts convert
# .ex/.exs to CRLF (via core.autocrlf) makes `mix format --check-formatted`
# fail on files nobody actually edited. Force LF for source Git tracks,
# regardless of local autocrlf settings. See docs/issues/ISS-0008.yaml.
*.ex text eol=lf
*.exs text eol=lf
